  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The terminal velocity, $v=\\frac{2 r^{2}(p-\\sigma) g}{9 \\eta}$\r\nAs, all other parameters are constant, therefore $v\\propto r^{2}$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad \\frac{v_{R}}{v_{3 R}}=\\frac{(R)^{2}}{(3 R)^{2}}=\\frac{1}{9}$",
